OL,3,GNEWSAVillage where 'people come to log
OL,4,Aoff' tops search ranking
OL,5,
OL,6,FBeing off the beaten track is helping a
OL,7,Fsmall seaside village become a tourism
OL,8,Fsuccess story, according to people who
OL,9,Flive and work there.
OL,11,FSkipsea, on the East Yorkshire coast,
OL,12,Fis home to the remains of a medieval
OL,13,Fcastle, a peaceful, sandy beach and an
OL,14,Faward-winning ice cream parlour.
OL,16,FNevertheless, local people were
OL,17,Fsurprised this month when the village,
OL,18,Fpopulation 700, was named the UK's
OL,19,Ffastest-growing destination for holiday
OL,20,Fsearches by a global travel website.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
