OL,3,GNEWSAVillage where 'people come to log
OL,4,Aoff' tops search ranking
OL,5,
OL,6,FBooking.com said online interest in the
OL,7,Fvillage was up 218% over the past year,
OL,8,Fplacing it alongside destinations such
OL,9,Fas Christchurch, in New Zealand, and
OL,10,FPescara in Italy ` though a media
OL,11,Frepresentative was unable to put a
OL,12,Fnumber on how many searches had
OL,13,Factually been made.
